#*: O '''coração''' de Harry batia acelerado agora.
#*:: Now, Harry's '''heart''' was beating very fast.
# {{context|figurative|lang=pt}} {{l/en|heart}}, {{l/en|emotions}}, {{l/en|kindness}}, {{l/en|spirit}}
